    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG McCormack Properties are delighted to offer this L Shaped detached bungalow to the market in Garryhill, Co. Carlow.\n\nBuilt in c 1899, the property extends to c. 120 m2 on a site of c. 0.44 acres. \n\nAccommodation comprises entrance hall, living room, kitchen/dining area, utility, 4 bedrooms and 1 main bathroom. \nThe well-appointed accommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hallway with laminate flooring, a lovely kitchen /dining area with a partitioned utility area with storage and fitted units leading out to the rear garden.\n\nIt boasts a long rear garden with a low maintenance partly tarmaced area with gated side access. There is a block built garage of c. 27 m2. The garden then leads on to a partly grass area.\n\nServices include private septic tank, oil fired central heating from oil burner, mains water and pre pay electricity. \n\nContact DNG McCormack today to arrange a viewing. 0599133800\n\nTo see current offers or place your own offer on this property, please visit mydng.ie and register."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 9.48m x 1m\nLaminate flooring, Prepay Electricity meter\n\nLiving Room - 3.98m x 3.46m\nLaminate flooring, open fireplace, built in storage\n\nBedroom 1 - 3m x 2.73m\nLaminate flooring, built in wardrobes, double room\n\nBathroom - 3.1m x 1.9m\nTiled floor, partially tiled walls, WC, WHB, Bath, Shower\n\nBedroom 2 - 4.2m x 3.13m\nDouble room, laminate floor, rear aspect\n\nBedroom 3 - 4.7m x 3.2m\nDouble room, laminate floor, rear aspect\n\nBedroom 4 - 3.62m x 3.3m\nDoube room, laminate floor, fitted wardrobe, side aspect\n\nKitchen and Dining Area - 5.78m x 3.61m\nLaminate floor, fitted kitchen, dual aspect\n\nUtility Room - 3.5m x 3.00m\nTiled floor, partitioned area, fitted units at eye and floor level, tiled splashback, rear access\n\n"
      },
